  "form_descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Les Mistigrix mâles et femelles ont des différentes capacités apprises en montant de niveau et talents. Bien que les différences de genre ne sont habituellement pas considérées comme des formes différentes, celles de Mistigrix le sont pour des raisons pratiques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Male and female Meowstic have different level-up moves and hidden abilities.  While gender differences are not usually considered to be separate forms, Meowstic’s are treated as such for practical purposes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "きけんが　せまると　みみを　もちあげ\n１０トン　トラックを　ひねりつぶす\nサイコパワーを　かいほうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "위험이 다가오면 귀를 들어 올리고\n10톤 트럭을 눌러 부술 정도의\n사이코 파워를 방출한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "S’il se sent menacé, il lève les oreilles et déchaîne\nun pouvoir psychique capable de réduire en miettes\nun camion de 10 t.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In Gefahrensituationen hebt es seine Ohren an und\nsetzt Psycho-Kräfte frei, die einen 10 t schweren LKW\nzu Schrott verarbeiten können.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando percibe peligro, yergue sus orejas y desata un\npoder psíquico capaz de levantar un camión de unas\n10 toneladas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se si sente minacciato, drizza le orecchie e libera un\npotere psichico devastante, in grado di accartocciare\nun camion da 10 t come se fosse una lattina.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When in danger, it raises its ears and\nreleases enough psychic power to\ngrind a 10-ton truck into dust.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "危険が　迫ると　耳を　持ち上げ\n１０トン　トラックを　ひねりつぶす\nサイコパワーを　解放する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando percibe peligro, yergue sus orejas y desata un\npoder psíquico capaz de levantar un camión de unas\n10 toneladas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みみの　うちがわの　めだまもようから\nサイコパワーを　だすが　あまりにも\nきょうりょくなので　ふさいでいる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "귀 안쪽의 눈알 모양에서\n사이코 파워를 내지만\n너무나도 강력하여 귀를 막고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les motifs en forme d’yeux à l’intérieur de ses oreilles\némettent une force psychique tellement puissante\nqu’il est contraint de les garder couverts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Über das Augenmuster auf der Innenseite seiner Ohren\nsetzt es seine Psycho-Kräfte frei. Da diese aber viel zu\nstark sind, hält es das Muster bedeckt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las marcas en forma de ojos que tiene en las orejas\nemiten poderes psíquicos, pero su potencia es tan\navasalladora que las mantiene tapadas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I motivi a forma di occhio all’interno delle orecchie\nsono la fonte del suo potere psichico. Li tiene coperti\nper controllarne l’immensa potenza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The eyeball patterns on the interior of its ears\nemit psychic energy. It keeps the patterns tightly\ncovered because that power is too immense.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "耳の　内側の　目玉模様から\nサイコパワーを　出すが\nあまりにも　強力なので　ふさいでいる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
