        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "귀 안쪽의 눈알 모양에서\n사이코 파워를 내지만 평소에는\n그 힘을 숨기고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從耳朵內側眼珠花紋的地方\n釋放出精神力量，但平時\n會將那種力量隱藏起來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les motifs en forme d’yeux, à l’intérieur de ses\noreilles, sont la source de ses pouvoirs psychiques.\nLa plupart du temps, il cache ces pouvoirs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Über das Augenmuster auf der Innenseite seiner\nOhren kann es seine Psycho-Kräfte freisetzen.\nFür gewöhnlich hält es sie aber verborgen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Emite sus poderes psíquicos por las marcas en\nforma de ojos que tiene en las orejas, aunque,\npor lo general, las mantiene ocultas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I motivi a forma di occhio all’interno delle\norecchie sono la fonte del suo potere psichico.\nDi solito tiene nascosti i suoi poteri.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Revealing the eyelike patterns on the insides of\nits ears will unleash its psychic powers. It normally\nkeeps the patterns hidden, however.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "耳の　内側の　目玉模様から\nサイコパワーを　放つが　普段は\nその　力を　隠している。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
